&\Rightarrow \frac{1}{(x-\frac{1}{n})^n} < \varepsilon n^3 \quad \forall \; n \geq N \\
&\Rightarrow \frac{1}{\varepsilon(x-\frac{1}{n})^n} < n^3 \quad \forall \; n \geq N
\end{align*}

