\noindent $\therefore \frac{C_1 \hat{v_1} + C_2 \cdot \hat{v_2} + C_i \hat{v_i} + C_n \cdot \hat{v_n}}{\sqrt{C_1^2 + C_2^2 + \cdots + C_n^2}} = \hat{u}$

\noindent multiply $\hat{v_i}$ both sides.

