Clearly, the a basis for $S$ is $\left\{ \begin{bmatrix} 13 \\ -11 \\ -3 \\ 1 \end{bmatrix} \right\}$ $\therefore$ span $\begin{bmatrix} 13 \\ -11 \\ -3 \\ 1 \end{bmatrix} = S$.

